[captions]
Screens cover every wall of Times Square, brighter than the sky above them.
Tourists stop in the middle of the sidewalk to film the billboards.
A news ticker wraps around the corner, scrolling headlines nobody reads.
Someone in a costume charges for photos under the screens.
